msgid ""
"Print the order receipt twice when it is created from the POS: two identical"
" tickets, one for the customer and one for the shop. Quotations are always "
"printed once, whatever this setting says. Only applies to the receipt "
"printed on creation, and requires \"Auto-print receipt on create\"."
msgstr ""
"Imprime dos veces el ticket del pedido al crearlo desde el TPV: dos tickets "
"idénticos, uno para el cliente y otro para la tienda. Las cotizaciones "
"siempre se imprimen una sola vez, sin importar este ajuste. Solo aplica al "
"ticket que se imprime al crear, y requiere \"Imprimir recibo al crear\"."

#. module: xb_sale_order_from_pos
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:xb_sale_order_from_pos.res_config_settings_view_form_xb
